message: "If you use DigiTwin in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DigiTwin"
abstract: >-
  Research-grade meshing toolkit that turns CAD drawings and closed or tubular
  triangulated surfaces into analysis-ready, tagged volume meshes and complete
  solver input decks for CalculiX, NASTRAN, OpenFOAM, FLUENT, LS-DYNA and ANSYS.
